ent": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le04ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sally, I read your last blog post, the one about emotional intelligence. Really compelling!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks! It's really interesting information, isn't it? What was especially provocative was how it can be applied at work.   <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes! Who you really need to apply it to is your boss! You are going to use some of the EI strategies to improve your relationship with her, aren't you?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le04ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, for sure! I can't wait to try and implement some of what I learned about EI. I think if I can understand my boss and her emotions better, I'll be better able to gauge her behavior and where it's coming from. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's the key, isn't it? When she is acting aggressively or being overly critical, you'll know how to effectively interact with her. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah, and I'll understand my own reactions to her. That I've been confused by her behavior isn't really surprising. I haven't looked for the reasons behind her conduct. That's been my problem, hasn't it?", "id": 2, "time": "24500", "image": "engenn9le04ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I think that if you can recognize that her behavior toward you is not personal, then you won't be so negatively affected by it. Who you should focus on changing a bit is you. Work on being more cognizant of other people's emotions and reactions, and you will feel more confident with your boss.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It sounds so easy, doesn't it?", "id": 3, "time": "57500", "image": "engenn9le04ob06re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le04ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le04ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}